<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>吃星星 Star Catcher</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
<div id="wrap">
  <canvas id="game" width="800" height="600"></canvas>
  <div id="hud">
    <span>得分 <b id="score">0</b></span>
    <span>时间 <b id="time">30</b></span>
    <span>最高分 <b id="best">0</b></span>
  </div>
  <div id="overlay">
    <h1 id="title">吃星星</h1>
    <p id="msg">方向键移动小球，30 秒内吃掉尽可能多的星星</p>
    <p class="hint">按 <kbd>空格</kbd> / <kbd>回车</kbd> 开始</p>
  </div>
</div>
<script src="game.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
